p:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Questions.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:32px;max-width:880px\"><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">What is a stablecoin payment gateway?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">A service that lets a business accept stablecoins such as USDC and USDT as payment and settle them into a balance or local currency.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Which stablecoins can customers pay with?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">USDC and USDT.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Can we settle into local currency?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes, to mobile money or bank accounts in 20 African countries.</p></details><details style=\"border-radius:20px;background:#fff\"><summary style=\"padding:22px 24px;font-weight:600;font-size:17px\">Is there a no-code option?</summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66\">Yes. Payment links can be created in the merchant dashboard without writing code.</p></details></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><div style=\"border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff;padding:clamp(36px,6vw,80px);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap